Noto Sans Symbols 2 bullet and checkbox subset:
Upstream: https://github.com/notofonts/symbols
Commit: 51303ca9e8ac9dcea7b12d307ba568fd0e6fcfca
Source SHA-256: 7d5fb73b7ca67a6798101741f5d280a3d016a56a197afcd4199dbb57b4b82a21
