The subset retains original naming and only the 17 codepoints below. It is a
monochrome semantic fallback, not original Symbol or Wingdings outline parity.
Reproduction uses FontTools 4.66.1 with this command:

pyftsubset NotoSansSymbols2-Regular.ttf --output-file=NotoSansSymbols2-bullets-subset.ttf --unicodes=U+21E8,U+25C6,U+25FB,U+2610,U+2611,U+2612,U+2713,U+2717,U+274D,U+2751,U+2752,U+2756,U+2794,U+27A2,U+29EB,U+2B25,U+2B27 --glyph-names --symbol-cmap --legacy-cmap --notdef-glyph --notdef-outline --recommended-glyphs --name-IDs=* --name-legacy --name-languages=* --layout-features=* --no-hinting
